{"id":"secolo","lemma":"secolo","pos":"noun","rank":1621,"glosses":["century (100 years)","age, time, era","ages (a very long time)"],"ipa":"/ˈsɛ.ko.lo/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c8/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-LangPao-secolo.wav/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-LangPao-secolo.wav.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"secoli"},"examples":[{"text":"Guardiamo avanti al prossimo secolo.","en":"Let's look ahead to the next century.","words":[{"g":"to look at","l":"guardare"},{"g":"come in!"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"very near, near, close"},null]},{"text":"Era secoli fa.","en":"It was ages ago.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"essere"},null,{"g":"to do","l":"fare"}]},{"text":"È nato nel diciannovesimo secolo.","en":"He was born in the 19th century.","words":[{"g":"is","l":"essere"},{"g":"born"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"nineteenth"},null]},{"text":"Il castello fu costruito nel diciassettesimo secolo.","en":"The castle was constructed in the 17th century.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"castle"},{"g":"deceased, late"},{"g":"to build, construct","l":"costruire"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"seventeenth"},null]},{"text":"La città è stata fondata nel 18° secolo.","en":"The town was established in the 18th century.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"town, city"},{"g":"is","l":"essere"},{"g":"state","l":"stato"},{"g":"founded, established","l":"fondato"},{"g":"in the"},null]}]}